1
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:10,220
You have to die.

2
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:07,660
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

3
00:03:09,700 --> 00:03:15,660
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

4
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:20,940
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

5
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:32,180
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

6
00:03:32,540 --> 00:03:39,300
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

7
00:03:40,540 --> 00:03:47,180
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

8
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:55,220
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

9
00:03:56,820 --> 00:04:03,340
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

10
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:09,900
[Blossom in Darkness]

11
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:11,900
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

12
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:14,900
[Episode 19]

13
00:04:16,250 --> 00:04:17,680
Youyou!

14
00:04:25,870 --> 00:04:26,370
Youyou.

15
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,220
Youyou.

16
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:48,980
Youyou.

17
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:54,610
Youyou.

18
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,050
Take a sip.

19
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,780
It'll heal you.

20
00:04:59,040 --> 00:04:59,700
Drink it.

21
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:00,730
Hurry.

22
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:08,140
Yamao,

23
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,100
it's no use.

24
00:05:16,750 --> 00:05:18,170
I'll get the Demon Soul Talisman back.

25
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,700
It's too late.

26
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,170
The Demon Soul Talisman

27
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,220
is my demonic core.

28
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,810
Shen Wangyan cut it out of me.

29
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,410
I'm dying.

30
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:47,410
Yamao,

31
00:05:49,630 --> 00:05:52,900
if you gave someone your whole heart

32
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,170
only to be used and betrayed,

33
00:05:59,830 --> 00:06:01,020
what would you do?

34
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:08,700
Don't be afraid.

35
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,460
Promise me, okay?

36
00:06:11,390 --> 00:06:12,540
Just make it through tonight,

37
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,930
and I'll make sure you see

38
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,020
the wicked get what they deserve.

39
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:38,610
Lingyue.

40
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:46,730
Lingyue,

41
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,980
from now on, this palace

42
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,340
is all yours.

43
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:51,730
You'll never have to live

44
00:06:51,750 --> 00:06:52,850
in that tiny bamboo hut again.

45
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:54,220
No.

46
00:06:55,310 --> 00:06:56,780
All of Luoliang Demon Capital is yours.

47
00:07:03,510 --> 00:07:04,900
Where's the Demon Soul Talisman?

48
00:07:05,810 --> 00:07:06,780
Haven't you found it yet?

49
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:08,470
I can't bear

50
00:07:08,470 --> 00:07:09,250
this pain anymore.

51
00:07:09,510 --> 00:07:10,970
Not for another second.

52
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:11,990
I've found it.

53
00:07:12,670 --> 00:07:13,650
I still need to refine it.

54
00:07:14,430 --> 00:07:15,450
I just need a few ingredients

55
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:16,700
to make it work for you.

56
00:07:17,230 --> 00:07:17,850
Wait a little longer.

57
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:20,620
Please go now, will you?

58
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:22,410
All right.

59
00:07:22,910 --> 00:07:23,530
I'll go now.

60
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:25,650
Don't be afraid.

61
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:27,140
By morning,

62
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:28,650
you'll be cured.

63
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:33,500
Wait for me.

64
00:07:50,230 --> 00:07:51,180
Who's there?

65
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:10,770
Who are you?

66
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:12,820
The Netherblood Fiend captured me

67
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:14,260
and held me prisoner in this city.

68
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,850
On New Year's Eve,

69
00:08:16,310 --> 00:08:17,850
the whole city was going to feast on me.

70
00:08:18,110 --> 00:08:19,650
Luckily, Shen Wangyan saved me.

71
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,650
So I suppose

72
00:08:21,990 --> 00:08:23,650
I'm in your debt too.

73
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:25,820
What are you getting at?

74
00:08:26,230 --> 00:08:28,020
I'm just here to offer some advice.

75
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:30,260
The Demon Soul Talisman was formed from a demonic core.

76
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:31,940
For a cultivator like you,

77
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:34,170
taking it as is won't help.

78
00:08:34,430 --> 00:08:35,740
It could even worsen your condition.

79
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:38,460
How do you know all this?

80
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:44,650
Because I know

81
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:46,340
all there is to know about medicine.

82
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,290
I'm the Moonlit Revival Herb.

83
00:08:49,070 --> 00:08:50,140
Would you like to know

84
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:51,570
exactly what it takes

85
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:53,280
to make the Demon Soul Talisman

86
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,410
work the way it should?

87
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:19,300
[Moonwatch Tower]

88
00:09:27,430 --> 00:09:28,530
This place is rich in spiritual power.

89
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,290
It's the perfect place to heal you.

90
00:10:02,710 --> 00:10:03,530
Why?

91
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:06,410
To cure myself with the Demon Soul Talisman,

92
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:09,860
I have to find the one person

93
00:10:09,910 --> 00:10:10,810
who loves me most

94
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,980
and use his heart as the catalyst.

95
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:17,260
I'm sorry, Wangyan. I'm sorry.

96
00:10:17,710 --> 00:10:18,930
But...

97
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,220
But I don't want to die.

98
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:21,770
I don't want to die!

99
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:32,020
How could I ever let you die?

100
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:34,740
I told you

101
00:10:35,710 --> 00:10:37,050
I'd always take care of you.

102
00:10:40,950 --> 00:10:41,620
Did you?

103
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,690
Do you have any idea

104
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:45,500
how much I've suffered

105
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:46,740
lying sick in bed all these years?

106
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,620
Yet you married that woman

107
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,020
and doted on her.

108
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,570
Every time I think about it,

109
00:10:55,950 --> 00:10:57,860
my heart aches so much I can't breathe!

110
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:02,050
I did it all for you.

111
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:04,460
That's why I was with her.

112
00:11:05,430 --> 00:11:06,220
I even went so far

113
00:11:07,590 --> 00:11:09,290
as to kill her with my own hands.

114
00:11:10,280 --> 00:11:11,530
How else could I have gotten

115
00:11:11,590 --> 00:11:13,980
the Demon Soul Talisman for you?

116
00:11:18,310 --> 00:11:19,050
I know.

117
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,050
I know.

118
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:22,810
I know.

119
00:11:23,830 --> 00:11:24,260
But...

120
00:11:25,070 --> 00:11:25,770
But, Wangyan,

121
00:11:26,190 --> 00:11:27,770
this is my only chance.

122
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:35,500
- Help me one more time. - Lingyue...

123
00:11:36,710 --> 00:11:37,890
Just help me one more time.

124
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:38,410
No.

125
00:11:39,310 --> 00:11:39,740
Don't.

126
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:42,050
Help me one more time,

127
00:11:42,310 --> 00:11:42,980
will you?

128
00:13:25,710 --> 00:13:26,620
Wonderful.

129
00:13:28,550 --> 00:13:29,570
I can finally

130
00:13:29,590 --> 00:13:31,020
live a normal life.

131
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:17,650
What...

132
00:14:18,950 --> 00:14:20,650
What did you do to Lingyue?

133
00:14:21,430 --> 00:14:22,620
She was only using you,

134
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:24,810
just like you used Youyou.

135
00:14:25,070 --> 00:14:25,740
Youyou,

136
00:14:27,950 --> 00:14:28,930
how are you

137
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:30,570
still alive?

138
00:14:39,310 --> 00:14:40,530
Shen Wangyan,

139
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,810
I kept myself alive

140
00:14:43,590 --> 00:14:44,410
just long enough

141
00:14:44,430 --> 00:14:45,930
to see you like this.

142
00:14:47,190 --> 00:14:48,500
Now you know how much it hurts

143
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,620
to have the person you love most

144
00:14:51,670 --> 00:14:53,690
rip your heart out

145
00:14:54,830 --> 00:14:55,810
while you're still alive.

146
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:09,100
No one had to die.

147
00:15:11,710 --> 00:15:13,340
Now I'm going to die,

148
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:16,690
and so are you.

149
00:15:55,590 --> 00:15:56,100
Youyou.

150
00:16:01,310 --> 00:16:02,050
Yamao,

151
00:16:03,430 --> 00:16:04,620
I promised you this.

152
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,130
I used blood from my heart

153
00:17:17,590 --> 00:17:19,020
to keep what's left of her soul from fading.

154
00:17:19,520 --> 00:17:20,940
She's too weak in this state

155
00:17:21,070 --> 00:17:22,180
to kill anyone.

156
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:25,610
But this demonic mist can become intangible,

157
00:17:26,590 --> 00:17:28,130
so no one will be able to kill her either.

158
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:34,090
I see.

159
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:35,900
So even you,

160
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:37,180
900 years from now,

161
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:39,330
won't be able to kill her.

162
00:17:41,150 --> 00:17:41,660
That means

163
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,980
Youyou can live a very, very long time,

164
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:44,900
long enough

165
00:17:45,870 --> 00:17:47,420
to wait hundreds of years

166
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,260
until we meet again.

167
00:17:57,070 --> 00:17:57,570
Youyou,

168
00:17:58,680 --> 00:17:59,420
next time we meet,

169
00:17:59,630 --> 00:18:00,700
don't try to eat me again!

170
00:18:37,590 --> 00:18:38,180
It's all my fault.

171
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:40,330
I was in the city the whole time.

172
00:18:40,870 --> 00:18:42,330
I already knew that centuries from now,

173
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:44,330
only a remnant of Youyou's soul would be left.

174
00:18:44,550 --> 00:18:45,660
Yet I did nothing about it.

175
00:18:46,350 --> 00:18:47,570
I just stood by

176
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,020
and watched her suffer like this.

177
00:18:50,110 --> 00:18:51,330
I'm the one to blame.

178
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:53,370
I misjudged that man

179
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:55,900
and was too quick to leave her in his care.

180
00:18:57,720 --> 00:18:58,460
But at least

181
00:18:58,870 --> 00:18:59,760
we already know

182
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:00,850
what will happen centuries from now.

183
00:19:01,350 --> 00:19:01,770
Yes.

184
00:19:02,550 --> 00:19:04,050
Luckily, 900 years from now,

185
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:05,460
we'll still meet Youyou

186
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:06,330
and get to know her.

187
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:10,020
When we're back in our own time,

188
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:11,610
I'll make sure

189
00:19:11,630 --> 00:19:12,660
she never suffers like this again.

190
00:19:15,630 --> 00:19:16,020
By the way,

191
00:19:16,590 --> 00:19:17,370
when Youyou lost control

192
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:18,460
and her demonic power erupted,

193
00:19:19,070 --> 00:19:20,500
she nearly killed me too.

194
00:19:21,040 --> 00:19:21,940
High Immortal Danshen

195
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:23,530
saved me by raising a barrier.

196
00:19:24,110 --> 00:19:25,370
He's still unconscious, though.

197
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:26,980
He probably acted on instinct.

198
00:19:28,350 --> 00:19:28,900
That's good news.

199
00:19:29,280 --> 00:19:30,050
That's great news!

200
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:32,290
It means Master is already recovering.

201
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:34,020
Now that he can protect himself,

202
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:35,330
I don't have to worry

203
00:19:35,350 --> 00:19:36,050
about his safety.

204
00:19:46,550 --> 00:19:47,420
You're giving it to me?

205
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,770
Aren't you coming back with me?

206
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:50,900
Of course I am.

207
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:52,420
But we need a little more time.

208
00:19:53,870 --> 00:19:54,940
Keep the talisman safe for now.

209
00:19:55,390 --> 00:19:56,180
Qi Fengyin and I

210
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:56,660
still have

211
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:57,700
something very important to do.

212
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:06,020
You've condensed the malice already?

213
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:07,460
All right. Come on. I'm ready.

214
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:12,050
Once the mystical flower is made to bloom

215
00:20:12,550 --> 00:20:13,770
and the soul inside is restored,

216
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:15,420
it will upset the balance,

217
00:20:16,040 --> 00:20:17,500
and Miss Yamao will be drained of her life force.

218
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:19,180
She won't survive.

219
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:23,700
Shen Wangyan mixed truth with lies.

220
00:20:25,870 --> 00:20:26,900
I have to find out for myself.

221
00:21:20,150 --> 00:21:20,660
Qi Fengyin,

222
00:21:20,830 --> 00:21:22,180
looks like just one more wisp of malice

223
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:23,460
will make your flower bloom!

224
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:44,050
We welcome your return, Saintess of the Tides!

225
00:21:46,070 --> 00:21:46,660
As soon as the sects heard

226
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:47,940
that you'd awakened, Saintess,

227
00:21:48,200 --> 00:21:49,850
we came straight to Mount Zhaowu to pay our respects.

228
00:21:50,040 --> 00:21:51,180
Now that you've awakened, Saintess,

229
00:21:51,480 --> 00:21:52,420
the immortal sects may finally

230
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:54,090
rid the world of that devil, Qi Fengyin.

231
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:56,370
Esteemed sect leaders,

232
00:21:57,390 --> 00:21:58,610
that is precisely why I summoned you.

233
00:21:59,000 --> 00:21:59,980
The sole purpose

234
00:22:00,840 --> 00:22:02,280
of my awakening

235
00:22:02,280 --> 00:22:03,290
is to kill Qi Fengyin.

236
00:22:03,870 --> 00:22:05,770
A thousand years ago, I failed at the last moment.

237
00:22:06,350 --> 00:22:06,900
I only managed

238
00:22:06,900 --> 00:22:08,460
to seal him away on Mount Qihuang.

239
00:22:08,870 --> 00:22:10,900
I couldn't kill him for good.

240
00:22:12,280 --> 00:22:13,020
This time,

241
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:15,980
we cannot make the same mistake.

242
00:22:18,070 --> 00:22:19,180
We stand ready

243
00:22:19,310 --> 00:22:20,810
to obey your orders, Saintess.

244
00:22:23,150 --> 00:22:24,330
Before my death, I bestowed

245
00:22:25,040 --> 00:22:26,660
a Sect Leader's Token

246
00:22:26,830 --> 00:22:27,900
on each of the Five Great Sects.

247
00:22:28,310 --> 00:22:28,900
Each token

248
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:31,500
can draw on the spiritual power of its region.

249
00:22:31,760 --> 00:22:33,130
To kill Qi Fengyin,

250
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:35,610
I will take back

251
00:22:35,870 --> 00:22:37,220
the five Sect Leaders' Tokens

252
00:22:37,630 --> 00:22:38,900
and fuse them into the Immortal Sect Token.

253
00:22:41,210 --> 00:22:41,680
Well...

254
00:22:43,200 --> 00:22:44,460
The Immortal Sect Token will be able

255
00:22:44,760 --> 00:22:46,370
to draw immortal power from all five sacred lands.

256
00:22:46,870 --> 00:22:48,610
But the slightest mistake

257
00:22:48,920 --> 00:22:50,610
would spell ruin for the Five Great Sects.

258
00:22:51,920 --> 00:22:53,500
Before you awakened, Saintess,

259
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:55,740
we were no match for Qi Fengyin on our own.

260
00:22:56,310 --> 00:22:58,370
Even then, we never considered fusing the tokens.

261
00:22:58,720 --> 00:23:00,420
The Saintess's Shrine has been moved several times,

262
00:23:00,790 --> 00:23:03,290
and its guardian, Danshen, has passed away.

263
00:23:03,870 --> 00:23:04,370
We simply

264
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:06,570
can't risk handing over the Sect Leaders' Tokens.

265
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:17,900
You're making all these excuses

266
00:23:18,870 --> 00:23:21,370
because you doubt I'm the Saintess.

267
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:24,770
Only one person alive

268
00:23:24,790 --> 00:23:26,420
poses a mortal threat to Qi Fengyin.

269
00:23:26,420 --> 00:23:27,370
And that's me.

270
00:23:29,590 --> 00:23:30,130
Very well.

271
00:23:32,070 --> 00:23:32,900
Soon enough,

272
00:23:34,720 --> 00:23:36,330
I'll show you

273
00:23:37,830 --> 00:23:39,180
what it means to be a deity.

274
00:23:56,790 --> 00:23:57,330
Eventually,

275
00:23:57,760 --> 00:23:59,090
this place will become

276
00:23:59,790 --> 00:24:00,900
Luoliang Immortal Sect's territory.

277
00:24:01,960 --> 00:24:02,790
There won't be

278
00:24:02,790 --> 00:24:03,410
a single trace left

279
00:24:03,410 --> 00:24:04,660
of the demons who lived here.

280
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:07,020
You said there was something important

281
00:24:07,390 --> 00:24:08,660
we absolutely had to do.

282
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:09,700
What is it?

283
00:24:10,150 --> 00:24:11,090
I went back to Luoshen Valley

284
00:24:11,630 --> 00:24:12,850
to ask Master

285
00:24:13,040 --> 00:24:13,980
a question about you.

286
00:24:14,720 --> 00:24:16,220
The Wanjun Lock is a divine artifact

287
00:24:16,280 --> 00:24:17,460
left behind by the Saintess of the Tides.

288
00:24:17,590 --> 00:24:19,260
It can only be awakened by the Five Great Sects together.

289
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:21,500
Anyone who must be subdued with the Wanjun Lock

290
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:23,810
is an enemy of all the immortal sects.

291
00:24:25,390 --> 00:24:26,290
The Wanjun Lock

292
00:24:26,720 --> 00:24:27,420
was forged in the fires of Mount Jigu.

293
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:28,500
Those flames have burned

294
00:24:28,520 --> 00:24:29,420
for 10,000 years without going out.

295
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:31,290
Only the flames of Mount Jigu

296
00:24:31,550 --> 00:24:32,500
can melt it down.

297
00:24:32,830 --> 00:24:33,530
Mount Jigu?

298
00:24:34,040 --> 00:24:34,980
Nine hundred years from now,

299
00:24:35,550 --> 00:24:36,940
Mount Jigu will already be gone.

300
00:24:37,280 --> 00:24:38,500
This is our best chance.

301
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:40,610
Once the lock stops holding you back,

302
00:24:40,870 --> 00:24:41,900
you'll be strong enough

303
00:24:43,040 --> 00:24:43,940
to stand against the Saintess

304
00:24:44,070 --> 00:24:45,330
when you're back in the present.

305
00:24:45,790 --> 00:24:46,460
You'll also be able

306
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:47,850
to reclaim the last wisp of malice.

307
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:48,770
Then you can

308
00:24:49,110 --> 00:24:49,900
revive the woman in the flower

309
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:51,370
for whom you've waited 1,000 years.

310
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:53,500
I want to uncover the truth about your past

311
00:24:54,520 --> 00:24:56,220
and clear your name after 1,000 years.

312
00:24:57,110 --> 00:24:58,260
Whatever others say about you,

313
00:24:58,830 --> 00:24:59,370
after everything

314
00:24:59,630 --> 00:25:00,940
we've been through together,

315
00:25:01,070 --> 00:25:02,050
I know you better than anyone else.

316
00:25:03,070 --> 00:25:04,850
You haven't brought calamity to the world.

317
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:06,770
You've been restoring peace to it.

318
00:25:07,590 --> 00:25:08,180
Qi Fengyin,

319
00:25:09,070 --> 00:25:10,370
don't let me down.

320
00:25:16,240 --> 00:25:16,770
Yamao,

321
00:25:18,480 --> 00:25:19,020
the truth is...

322
00:25:19,150 --> 00:25:20,810
And most importantly,

323
00:25:21,550 --> 00:25:23,700
once we're back in the present

324
00:25:24,110 --> 00:25:25,700
and you're free of the Wanjun Lock,

325
00:25:27,070 --> 00:25:29,020
we'll go

326
00:25:29,870 --> 00:25:30,610
our separate ways.

327
00:25:34,280 --> 00:25:35,420
You're going back to Luoshen Valley?

328
00:25:36,310 --> 00:25:36,940
Yes.

329
00:25:37,590 --> 00:25:38,940
Once we're back in the present,

330
00:25:39,150 --> 00:25:40,940
Master should wake up.

331
00:25:42,040 --> 00:25:44,180
A rain of fire destroyed Luoshen Valley.

332
00:25:45,350 --> 00:25:46,740
There's a lot of work to do there.

333
00:25:51,630 --> 00:25:53,090
What makes you think

334
00:25:53,830 --> 00:25:55,530
I'll let you go

335
00:25:56,040 --> 00:25:57,330
before I've reclaimed all my malice?

336
00:25:59,550 --> 00:26:01,290
Once you're free of the Wanjun Lock,

337
00:26:01,790 --> 00:26:03,770
you'll be Qi Fengyin of Mount Qihuang again,

338
00:26:04,000 --> 00:26:06,220
the man whose name alone makes people tremble.

339
00:26:06,550 --> 00:26:07,740
You won't need my help at all.

340
00:26:08,520 --> 00:26:09,020
What's wrong?

341
00:26:09,550 --> 00:26:11,770
Can't bear to part with me?

342
00:26:14,070 --> 00:26:14,940
I won't let you go.

343
00:26:15,790 --> 00:26:16,530
If you ever

344
00:26:16,550 --> 00:26:17,570
find yourself in danger,

345
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:19,460
no one will be able to save you or the flower.

346
00:26:19,830 --> 00:26:21,130
I'll stay put in Luoshen Valley.

347
00:26:21,590 --> 00:26:22,500
What could happen to me there?

348
00:26:23,760 --> 00:26:24,420
Once you've reclaimed

349
00:26:24,440 --> 00:26:25,260
the last wisp of malice

350
00:26:25,720 --> 00:26:26,660
and refined the Devil's Heart,

351
00:26:27,040 --> 00:26:28,020
come find me to water the flower.

352
00:26:44,040 --> 00:26:45,180
Oh, Qingxing.

353
00:26:45,870 --> 00:26:46,700
Please don't

354
00:26:46,760 --> 00:26:47,700
let me down.

355
00:26:48,150 --> 00:26:48,940
You have to help His Lordship

356
00:26:48,960 --> 00:26:50,330
and Yamao get through this.

357
00:26:50,630 --> 00:26:51,700
It's my only chance

358
00:26:51,760 --> 00:26:52,570
to get the talisman back

359
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:54,940
and start cultivating again.

360
00:27:05,310 --> 00:27:06,940
Save yourselves the trouble.

361
00:27:07,390 --> 00:27:08,180
I'll never

362
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:08,900
tell you a thing.

363
00:27:09,280 --> 00:27:09,980
You don't have to say a word.

364
00:27:10,870 --> 00:27:11,810
All you have to do

365
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:13,850
is reopen the rift

366
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:15,530
you sent Qingxing through.

367
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:18,180
You don't really think

368
00:27:18,790 --> 00:27:19,700
Qingxing and Yamao

369
00:27:19,700 --> 00:27:21,130
are in the same place, do you?

370
00:27:21,680 --> 00:27:22,740
Think about it.

371
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:24,850
I loathe immortal cultivators.

372
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:25,660
Why would I ever

373
00:27:25,720 --> 00:27:26,940
send a Mount Zhaowu disciple

374
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:28,180
to Yamao?

375
00:27:28,350 --> 00:27:29,090
Still keeping up the act?

376
00:27:45,760 --> 00:27:47,180
The talisman shard's spiritual power is unstable.

377
00:27:47,390 --> 00:27:48,570
Even with your divine power,

378
00:27:48,680 --> 00:27:50,050
you might not make it through safely.

379
00:27:50,390 --> 00:27:52,530
You could be torn to pieces.

380
00:28:03,590 --> 00:28:04,050
Yinhua.

381
00:28:05,590 --> 00:28:06,180
Hao?

382
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:09,090
You knew the portal could be reopened.

383
00:28:09,310 --> 00:28:10,090
Why didn't you tell me?

384
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:12,290
I...

385
00:28:17,870 --> 00:28:18,900
Mount Zhaowu

386
00:28:19,070 --> 00:28:20,180
needs you here to lead it.

387
00:28:20,310 --> 00:28:21,090
You're the sect leader.

388
00:28:21,310 --> 00:28:22,180
You can't just rush off.

389
00:28:23,110 --> 00:28:23,980
Capturing Qi Fengyin

390
00:28:25,040 --> 00:28:26,090
is what matters most.

391
00:28:27,520 --> 00:28:28,700
Is this about catching Qi Fengyin,

392
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:30,090
or are you worried about Yamao?

393
00:28:30,550 --> 00:28:31,810
She openly joined forces with that devil

394
00:28:32,040 --> 00:28:32,810
against the Five Great Sects.

395
00:28:33,150 --> 00:28:34,220
She's a traitor to the immortal sects.

396
00:28:34,280 --> 00:28:35,220
Anyone may kill her.

397
00:28:35,350 --> 00:28:36,700
You're the leader of Mount Zhaowu.

398
00:28:37,310 --> 00:28:38,460
Why risk your reputation for her?

399
00:28:41,830 --> 00:28:42,770
I don't need you

400
00:28:43,870 --> 00:28:44,810
to tell me what to do.

401
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:54,610
Hao,

402
00:28:54,960 --> 00:28:56,050
there's too much at stake.

403
00:28:56,960 --> 00:28:57,660
You can punish me

404
00:28:58,550 --> 00:28:59,610
when I return.

405
00:29:01,830 --> 00:29:02,330
Yinhua!

406
00:29:06,390 --> 00:29:07,330
This is a divine talisman

407
00:29:07,350 --> 00:29:08,260
left by the Saintess of the Tides.

408
00:29:12,940 --> 00:29:14,980
[Mount Jigu]

409
00:29:38,720 --> 00:29:40,020
This place is downright deadly.

410
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,610
We'd better make this quick.

411
00:29:41,790 --> 00:29:42,330
I don't want

412
00:29:42,520 --> 00:29:43,570
to end up a charred little herb.

413
00:29:51,280 --> 00:29:52,610
We shouldn't go any farther.

414
00:29:53,350 --> 00:29:53,850
Let's turn back.

415
00:29:59,000 --> 00:29:59,500
Are you all right?

416
00:30:00,520 --> 00:30:01,020
It hurts.

417
00:30:01,240 --> 00:30:02,260
Good thing it's nighttime.

418
00:30:02,680 --> 00:30:04,050
I have enough spiritual power to heal fast.

419
00:30:04,390 --> 00:30:05,810
Then quit acting tough.

420
00:30:06,390 --> 00:30:07,090
I'll go in alone.

421
00:30:07,670 --> 00:30:08,180
Wait.

422
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:10,900
If you go in like that,

423
00:30:11,200 --> 00:30:12,500
won't you burn to a crisp too?

424
00:30:14,830 --> 00:30:16,260
The flames shouldn't hurt me.

425
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:21,850
Who's acting tough now?

426
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:24,610
Hold still.

427
00:30:42,280 --> 00:30:43,050
If you go in there

428
00:30:43,070 --> 00:30:44,020
and burn to ash,

429
00:30:44,350 --> 00:30:45,260
I won't even have a body

430
00:30:45,280 --> 00:30:45,980
to bury.

431
00:30:47,920 --> 00:30:49,660
We're the best of friends, after all.

432
00:30:50,480 --> 00:30:51,850
I'll help you see this through.

433
00:30:53,870 --> 00:30:55,290
You have a plan, don't you?

434
00:30:59,040 --> 00:30:59,740
We've got this.

435
00:31:00,040 --> 00:31:01,770
It's what protected my heart earlier.

436
00:31:02,070 --> 00:31:02,770
This necklace

437
00:31:03,440 --> 00:31:05,020
holds the source of that spring water.

438
00:31:05,310 --> 00:31:05,900
I didn't expect it

439
00:31:06,040 --> 00:31:07,460
to ward off the flames here.

440
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:19,850
If I stay here and keep

441
00:31:19,870 --> 00:31:20,530
channeling my power,

442
00:31:20,800 --> 00:31:22,060
the spring water in this necklace

443
00:31:22,310 --> 00:31:23,330
will form a shield

444
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:24,900
to keep you safe in there.

445
00:31:25,040 --> 00:31:25,740
What about you?

446
00:31:26,040 --> 00:31:27,290
I'll wait out here, of course.

447
00:31:27,680 --> 00:31:28,370
Don't worry.

448
00:31:28,630 --> 00:31:29,660
I'll be right here

449
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:30,370
keeping the shield up.

450
00:31:31,440 --> 00:31:32,370
I'll be back as fast as I can.

451
00:31:32,680 --> 00:31:33,370
You'd better.

452
00:31:34,310 --> 00:31:35,090
As soon as the sun comes up,

453
00:31:35,280 --> 00:31:35,770
the heat from Mount Jigu

454
00:31:35,790 --> 00:31:37,020
will bake me to a crisp.

455
00:31:38,720 --> 00:31:39,090
All right.

456
00:31:50,680 --> 00:31:51,500
Close your eyes.

457
00:31:52,960 --> 00:31:53,500
Why?

458
00:31:54,830 --> 00:31:55,810
Just close them.

459
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:19,130
I don't feel right leaving you here

460
00:32:19,590 --> 00:32:20,370
on your own.

461
00:32:20,630 --> 00:32:21,460
This dark mark

462
00:32:22,110 --> 00:32:23,850
will let us sense each other for a while.

463
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:25,020
If you're ever

464
00:32:25,040 --> 00:32:26,050
in danger out here,

465
00:32:26,520 --> 00:32:27,570
I'll know right away.

466
00:32:28,040 --> 00:32:28,610
Then

467
00:32:28,830 --> 00:32:30,370
if you run into danger in there,

468
00:32:30,760 --> 00:32:31,570
will I know too?

469
00:32:31,720 --> 00:32:32,180
Yes.

470
00:32:35,630 --> 00:32:36,330
Go on.

471
00:32:36,870 --> 00:32:37,530
Don't worry about me.

472
00:32:39,310 --> 00:32:40,330
I can take care of myself.

473
00:32:50,630 --> 00:32:51,940
Since I left Luoshen Valley,

474
00:32:52,550 --> 00:32:53,500
it's been one ordeal after another.

475
00:32:54,550 --> 00:32:56,050
Things are finally getting back to normal,

476
00:32:57,240 --> 00:32:58,700
but part of me isn't ready for this to end.

477
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:14,500
Mount Jigu.

478
00:33:15,070 --> 00:33:17,130
Why would Qi Fengyin come here?

479
00:33:27,790 --> 00:33:28,740
With my limited cultivation,

480
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:31,420
I'm afraid I can't withstand these flames.

481
00:33:34,150 --> 00:33:34,980
Please, Saintess,

482
00:33:35,760 --> 00:33:37,050
kill Qi Fengyin for good

483
00:33:37,870 --> 00:33:38,850
so he can never

484
00:33:39,480 --> 00:33:40,740
endanger the immortal sects again.

485
00:34:59,400 --> 00:34:59,980
I wonder

486
00:35:00,040 --> 00:35:01,020
how he's doing in there.

487
00:35:07,440 --> 00:35:08,980
Why do I feel like something's missing

488
00:35:12,070 --> 00:35:13,900
every time I think of Qi Fengyin?

489
00:35:17,750 --> 00:35:18,460
Oh, forget it.

490
00:35:18,920 --> 00:35:20,290
It must be because he's worked me

491
00:35:20,290 --> 00:35:21,210
to the bone all this time.

492
00:35:21,480 --> 00:35:23,210
Now that we're about to part ways,

493
00:35:23,630 --> 00:35:25,300
I guess it just feels strange.

494
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:27,130
What I should be thinking about

495
00:35:27,440 --> 00:35:28,940
is how to restore Luoshen Valley.

496
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:32,820
I knew it was you.

497
00:35:40,190 --> 00:35:41,420
Is that what you're using

498
00:35:41,750 --> 00:35:42,940
to shield Qi Fengyin?

499
00:35:43,040 --> 00:35:43,530
Yinhua,

500
00:35:44,750 --> 00:35:45,900
I have no quarrel with you.

501
00:35:46,520 --> 00:35:47,820
Why are you coming after me like this?

502
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:49,380
I gave you a chance.

503
00:35:49,960 --> 00:35:50,730
The immortal sects

504
00:35:50,750 --> 00:35:51,940
also took you back

505
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:53,380
and repaired the talisman for you

506
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:54,170
to save your master.

507
00:35:54,880 --> 00:35:56,380
It was you who threw it all away.

508
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:58,250
You chose to consort with that devil

509
00:35:58,590 --> 00:35:59,690
and break the immortal sects' rules.

510
00:36:01,070 --> 00:36:02,650
You and that devil both deserve

511
00:36:03,960 --> 00:36:05,170
to die for what you've done.

512
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:10,460
It's only because you're a Mount Zhaowu disciple

513
00:36:10,710 --> 00:36:12,050
that I'm holding back.

514
00:36:13,110 --> 00:36:14,460
You're no match for me.

515
00:36:15,440 --> 00:36:16,340
Wait till dawn.

516
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:18,020
We'll see about that.

517
00:37:42,550 --> 00:37:43,690
A thousand years have passed.

518
00:37:44,630 --> 00:37:45,380
Qi Fengyin,

519
00:37:46,520 --> 00:37:48,300
you've finally restored my soul.

520
00:37:50,960 --> 00:37:51,980
I did it.

521
00:37:58,110 --> 00:37:58,730
Yes.

522
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:02,460
You stayed alone on Mount Qihuang

523
00:38:02,840 --> 00:38:04,250
for 1,000 years without ever leaving,

524
00:38:04,630 --> 00:38:06,340
absorbing malice day after day

525
00:38:06,920 --> 00:38:07,900
until you became the Devil Incarnate.

526
00:38:09,230 --> 00:38:10,940
Now you finally have enough power to bring

527
00:38:11,480 --> 00:38:12,730
the mystical flower into full bloom.

528
00:38:15,480 --> 00:38:16,090
From now on,

529
00:38:19,670 --> 00:38:20,940
we'll never be apart again.

530
00:38:40,750 --> 00:38:42,860
Something's wrong with the dark mark. What's going on?

531
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:45,500
Qi Fengyin.

532
00:38:57,550 --> 00:38:58,500
The Saintess of the Tides?

533
00:39:00,110 --> 00:39:00,900
I should've known.

534
00:39:01,320 --> 00:39:02,170
On your own,

535
00:39:02,230 --> 00:39:02,680
how could you

536
00:39:02,680 --> 00:39:03,980
have forced Youyou to reopen the portal?

537
00:39:26,440 --> 00:39:27,860
I can't break through by force.

538
00:39:28,480 --> 00:39:29,210
It seems

539
00:39:29,550 --> 00:39:31,020
the only way to get your Devil's Heart

540
00:39:31,520 --> 00:39:33,730
is for you to offer it up willingly.

541
00:39:39,110 --> 00:39:41,170
This is how Mount Qihuang once looked.

542
00:39:43,590 --> 00:39:45,020
You and I spent

543
00:39:47,320 --> 00:39:48,530
a long, long time here

544
00:39:49,110 --> 00:39:50,170
together.

545
00:39:52,000 --> 00:39:53,250
But I don't remember

546
00:39:55,480 --> 00:39:56,460
any of that.

547
00:40:01,920 --> 00:40:03,570
It doesn't matter if you've forgotten.

548
00:40:05,190 --> 00:40:06,460
We're finally together again.

549
00:40:07,920 --> 00:40:09,420
We can still start over.

550
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:14,730
Qi Fengyin,

551
00:40:15,800 --> 00:40:16,940
stay here with me

552
00:40:17,920 --> 00:40:18,980
forever.

553
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:21,250
Lifetime after lifetime,

554
00:40:23,230 --> 00:40:24,170
we'll never part.

555
00:40:54,960 --> 00:40:55,730
What are you looking at?

556
00:41:06,000 --> 00:41:06,610
Nothing.

557
00:41:08,440 --> 00:41:09,610
Try one of the pastries I made.

558
00:41:15,750 --> 00:41:17,050
I'm not unreasonable.

559
00:41:17,440 --> 00:41:18,780
I've noticed every single thing

560
00:41:18,800 --> 00:41:19,690
you've done for me.

561
00:41:20,190 --> 00:41:21,380
I know you like sweets,

562
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:22,610
so I bought you these.

563
00:41:23,150 --> 00:41:24,980
After all, we're the best of friends.

564
00:41:34,400 --> 00:41:34,980
What's wrong?

565
00:41:36,360 --> 00:41:37,090
Are you tired?

566
00:41:40,440 --> 00:41:41,500
Let's go back and rest.

567
00:41:45,920 --> 00:41:47,530
I've been catching glimpses of someone lately.

568
00:41:48,320 --> 00:41:49,610
She's here on Mount Qihuang.

569
00:41:50,880 --> 00:41:51,650
Do you know her?

570
00:41:54,960 --> 00:41:56,460
I've never met her.

571
00:41:57,630 --> 00:41:58,940
But it feels

572
00:41:59,320 --> 00:42:00,420
like we've been through

573
00:42:00,480 --> 00:42:01,780
so much together.

574
00:42:04,360 --> 00:42:05,780
Don't be silly.

575
00:42:07,400 --> 00:42:09,050
I'm the one who's been by your side

576
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:10,860
all this time.

577
00:42:13,270 --> 00:42:14,170
But I don't want

578
00:42:14,230 --> 00:42:15,380
to spend my life with you.

579
00:42:17,440 --> 00:42:18,900
I have unfinished business.

580
00:42:26,320 --> 00:42:27,500
The malice within you

581
00:42:27,750 --> 00:42:29,170
hasn't been fully condensed.

582
00:42:30,840 --> 00:42:32,090
What you're seeing

583
00:42:32,670 --> 00:42:34,170
must be the work of inner demons

584
00:42:34,400 --> 00:42:35,420
born of that malice.

585
00:42:36,590 --> 00:42:37,250
Don't be afraid.

586
00:42:38,880 --> 00:42:40,090
I'll always be by your side

587
00:42:41,230 --> 00:42:42,610
to help you purge the malice

588
00:42:42,920 --> 00:42:43,980
and overcome your inner demons.

589
00:42:44,920 --> 00:42:45,610
Qi Fengyin,

590
00:42:46,360 --> 00:42:47,380
I'm the only one in this world

591
00:42:47,400 --> 00:42:48,570
who loves you.

592
00:42:50,440 --> 00:42:51,090
As long as I'm here,

593
00:42:51,150 --> 00:42:52,610
no one can hurt you.

594
00:43:10,550 --> 00:43:11,300
What happened?

595
00:43:11,710 --> 00:43:12,780
The immortal sects

596
00:43:13,800 --> 00:43:15,130
are laying siege to Mount Qihuang.

597
00:43:16,630 --> 00:43:17,900
There's nothing more I can do.

598
00:43:18,960 --> 00:43:19,860
Go. Hurry.

599
00:43:35,920 --> 00:43:36,820
How can I save you?

600
00:43:44,270 --> 00:43:45,420
Your Devil's Heart

601
00:43:46,630 --> 00:43:48,090
holds 10,000 years' worth of malice.

602
00:43:49,270 --> 00:43:50,500
Its power rivals that of the gods.

603
00:43:52,270 --> 00:43:53,460
Give it to me,

604
00:43:54,800 --> 00:43:56,860
and I might still survive.

605
00:44:19,400 --> 00:44:20,610
Yinhua's determined to kill me.

606
00:44:21,590 --> 00:44:23,210
If I'm going to die here anyway,

607
00:44:23,960 --> 00:44:25,090
I might as well kill her first.

608
00:44:41,840 --> 00:44:43,380
Qi Fengyin must be in danger now.

609
00:44:49,710 --> 00:44:50,500
What little power I have left

610
00:44:51,270 --> 00:44:52,420
has to last until I wake him up.

611
00:45:04,230 --> 00:45:04,730
Qi Fengyin.

612
00:45:05,190 --> 00:45:06,020
Qi Fengyin, stop!

613
00:45:08,710 --> 00:45:09,300
Qi Fengyin!

614
00:45:09,750 --> 00:45:11,020
The Saintess cast this illusion.

615
00:45:11,070 --> 00:45:11,780
Don't believe her!

616
00:45:12,440 --> 00:45:13,460
You're not on Mount Qihuang!

617
00:45:13,670 --> 00:45:15,300
Qi Fengyin, wake up!

618
00:45:18,230 --> 00:45:19,250
If you dare cut out the Devil's Heart,

619
00:45:19,480 --> 00:45:20,610
I'll destroy your mystical flower.

620
00:45:20,800 --> 00:45:21,860
Do you hear me, Qi Fengyin?

621
00:45:43,880 --> 00:45:44,500
Yamao!

622
00:46:17,440 --> 00:46:18,340
You were dragged into this

623
00:46:19,110 --> 00:46:20,460
through no fault of your own.

624
00:46:21,360 --> 00:46:24,020
Hate me or curse me all you want,

625
00:46:25,150 --> 00:46:27,170
but I won't let you live to see tomorrow.

626
00:47:45,320 --> 00:47:46,130
Qi Fengyin,

627
00:47:47,190 --> 00:47:47,940
the Wanjun Lock...

628
00:47:48,190 --> 00:47:48,980
It's broken.

629
00:47:51,040 --> 00:47:52,050
And the Devil's Heart?

630
00:47:52,920 --> 00:47:53,610
It's safe.

631
00:47:57,520 --> 00:47:59,090
Didn't you say you'd be right back?

632
00:48:00,070 --> 00:48:01,460
I almost got baked to a crisp.

633
00:48:04,040 --> 00:48:05,050
It won't happen again.

634
00:48:08,070 --> 00:48:09,820
It's all thanks to me

635
00:48:10,750 --> 00:48:11,460
that we made it

636
00:48:12,230 --> 00:48:13,690
out of this in one piece.

637
00:48:16,520 --> 00:48:17,090
Yamao.

638
00:48:49,320 --> 00:48:49,980
Get out of my way.

639
00:48:53,320 --> 00:48:54,650
Yinhua is a disciple of Mount Zhaowu.

640
00:48:55,630 --> 00:48:56,980
She's committed a grave offense.

641
00:48:57,360 --> 00:48:58,500
Mount Zhaowu will deal with her.

642
00:48:58,710 --> 00:48:59,170
Hao,

643
00:48:59,520 --> 00:49:00,300
don't waste your breath on him.

644
00:49:00,400 --> 00:49:00,860
Shut up!

645
00:49:02,440 --> 00:49:03,420
I want her dead.

646
00:49:08,630 --> 00:49:10,020
As the leader of Mount Zhaowu,

647
00:49:10,750 --> 00:49:12,980
I let this happen by failing to keep her in line.

648
00:49:13,590 --> 00:49:15,130
If you must take your anger out on someone,

649
00:49:15,880 --> 00:49:16,500
take it out on me.

650
00:49:16,960 --> 00:49:18,210
As you wish.

651
00:49:22,320 --> 00:49:22,780
Hao!

652
00:49:23,840 --> 00:49:24,300
Hao...

653
00:49:27,230 --> 00:49:27,900
Qi Fengyin,

654
00:49:28,550 --> 00:49:29,130
now isn't the time

655
00:49:29,150 --> 00:49:30,340
to vent your anger.

656
00:49:31,150 --> 00:49:32,170
Yamao's badly hurt.

657
00:49:32,710 --> 00:49:33,610
Hand her over to me.

658
00:49:34,110 --> 00:49:35,380
In your dreams.

659
00:49:39,150 --> 00:49:39,940
What's happening?

660
00:50:18,710 --> 00:50:19,860
Hao, Yinhua,

661
00:50:20,400 --> 00:50:21,170
are you two all right?

662
00:50:44,040 --> 00:50:46,130
Give me back my disciple.

663
00:50:51,440 --> 00:50:53,380
Only I can heal Yamao's wounds.

664
00:50:53,840 --> 00:50:54,940
Let me take her back.

665
00:51:18,440 --> 00:51:19,020
High Immortal,

666
00:51:19,480 --> 00:51:20,570
the talisman is running out of power,

667
00:51:20,800 --> 00:51:22,050
and this place is starting to collapse.

668
00:51:22,440 --> 00:51:23,130
Let's go back.

669
00:52:22,270 --> 00:52:23,900
Master!

670
00:52:24,070 --> 00:52:25,010
Do you have any idea

671
00:52:25,010 --> 00:52:26,510
how much I went through

672
00:52:26,510 --> 00:52:27,690
to save you?

673
00:52:28,270 --> 00:52:29,650
I just don't get it.

674
00:52:29,920 --> 00:52:31,610
What's Danshen got that His Lordship doesn't?

675
00:52:31,800 --> 00:52:32,770
Can't you see

676
00:52:32,800 --> 00:52:33,730
His Lordship is

677
00:52:33,730 --> 00:52:34,700
the best man in the world?

678
00:52:35,400 --> 00:52:36,770
He's fallen hopelessly in love

679
00:52:36,770 --> 00:52:37,900
with you.

680
00:53:11,740 --> 00:53:17,500
♪Life and death find no harbor in your cloudy eyes♪

681
00:53:18,980 --> 00:53:24,620
♪Words across a thousand years gently caress the abyss♪

682
00:53:25,260 --> 00:53:32,140
♪One thought sows karma. Who knows right from wrong? Love entwines the stars♪

683
00:53:32,260 --> 00:53:38,180
♪We cross paths through lifetimes, rekindling the sparks of time♪

684
00:53:39,700 --> 00:53:45,340
♪In this fleeting, haunted life, good and evil blur, ensnaring you and me♪

685
00:53:47,020 --> 00:53:52,700
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world♪

686
00:53:53,020 --> 00:53:57,460
♪Dawn and dusk gain color at our fingertips♪

687
00:53:57,580 --> 00:54:00,540
♪Our vows live on in ink♪

688
00:54:00,660 --> 00:54:06,380
♪No matter what storms may rise behind us♪

689
00:54:07,220 --> 00:54:09,660
♪One day, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

690
00:54:09,660 --> 00:54:14,260
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

691
00:54:14,260 --> 00:54:16,620
♪Sleepless through bloodshed and strife♪

692
00:54:16,620 --> 00:54:20,820
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

693
00:54:21,060 --> 00:54:23,340
♪Across vast mountains and rivers♪

694
00:54:23,340 --> 00:54:25,140
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

695
00:54:25,140 --> 00:54:28,060
♪Together, we'll walk through time's depths and shallows♪

696
00:54:28,060 --> 00:54:30,220
♪Before all splendor fades♪

697
00:54:30,220 --> 00:54:34,860
♪With no regrets, we etch a lifetime of devotion♪

698
00:54:35,380 --> 00:54:37,780
♪In this life, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

699
00:54:37,820 --> 00:54:42,420
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

700
00:54:42,420 --> 00:54:44,780
♪We cannot escape the wind and snow♪

701
00:54:44,820 --> 00:54:48,980
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

702
00:54:49,220 --> 00:54:51,500
♪As seas turn to fields♪

703
00:54:51,500 --> 00:54:53,300
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

704
00:54:53,300 --> 00:54:56,220
♪Together, we'll break free of the cocoon fate has spun♪

705
00:54:56,220 --> 00:54:58,340
♪Before all splendor fades♪

706
00:54:58,340 --> 00:55:07,380
♪With no regrets, we etch a lifetime of devotion♪
